<title>USA: Matrix Capital Corp year shr $0.76.</title>
<headline>Matrix Capital Corp year shr $0.76.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matrix Capital Corp said net income for the year ended Dec. 31, 1996 was $3,272,000, or $0.76 per share (fully diluted), after a $268,000 one-time SAIF assessment to recapitalize the deposit insurance fund during 1996. Net income excluding this one-time SAIF expense would have been $3,540,000 for the year ended Dec. 31, 1996.</p>
<p>As of Dec. 31, 1996, total assets exceeded $265 million and total shareholders' equity was $30.8 million.  Market capitalization as of year-end 1996 was in excess of $90 million.</p>
</text>
